{"id":"wb-7-1043","name":"长庆寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"长庆寺塔","text":"长庆寺塔位于中华人民共和国安徽省黄山市歙县徽城镇城南西干山麓，今太平兴国寺前，北临练江，始建于北宋重和二年（1119），为古徽州现存年代最早的塔，因塔旁原有长庆寺故名，今寺毁塔存，经历代多次修缮，仍保持宋代特征。2013年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n该塔为七层四面的砖木结构楼阁式塔，高23.1米，底层边长5.28米，实心，底部设有须弥座，底层外设回廊，四面均辟券门，门内置石雕莲瓣佛座，上部各层则四面隐出券窗，转角设方形倚柱，各层均以相间的菱角牙子和板檐砖叠涩挑出木构腰檐，其上覆以筒板瓦，墙面绘有彩色佛像图案。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%86%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89643095,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89643095","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/00dcc827f047c6ac0548295f.jpg","title":"The_Pagoda_in_Changqing_Temple_05_2014-11.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Pagoda_in_Changqing_Temple_05_2014-11.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/The_Pagoda_in_Changqing_Temple_05_2014-11.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​歙县长庆寺塔，东面。","width":320,"height":482}}